  "details": "1. Open android mobile app (beta version) on smartphone (I used Xiaomi Realme 11). The problem often appears, when the device is charged around 50%-80% and is not connected to power adapter.\n\n2. Enter any non-empty world.\n\n3. Select any player in the world, and use quick menu to show their original avatar instead of impostor version.\n\nThere is a high chance for unwanted blue hightlight (similar to interactable objects hightlight) around the avatar to appear. It's not going away until switching back to the impostor version.\n\nBuild 1554",
